  - [ ] `scribe` command works
  - [ ] `scribe-admin` command works

**Task 5.7: Verify Package Data**
- **Check**: templates/, config/ files accessible
- **Verification**: 
  - [ ] Templates render
  - [ ] Config files load

**Exit Criteria**:
- ✅ Code in src/scribe_mcp/
- ✅ `pip install scribe_mcp` works
- ✅ All 50+ path resolutions fixed
- ✅ All entry points work
- ✅ All tests pass

