## Milestone Tracking

**Phase 1**: Immediate Cleanup → **Week 1, Day 1-2**  
**Phase 2**: Foundation (Logging + Security) → **Week 1, Day 3-5**  
**Phase 3**: Storage Decomposition → **Week 2, Day 1-5**  
**Phase 4**: Doc Management Decomposition → **Week 3, Day 1-5**  
**Phase 5**: src/ Layout Migration → **Week 4, Day 1-6**  
**Phase 6**: Database Consolidation → **Week 4, Day 7 + Week 5, Day 1**  
**Phase 7**: Postgres Completion → **Week 5, Day 2-7**  
**Phase 8**: Reminder Wire-Up → **Week 6, Day 1-4**  
**Phase 9**: Startup Performance → **Week 6, Day 5-7**  
**Phase 10**: Test Suite + Auth Scaffold → **Week 7, Day 1-4**

**Total Duration**: 6-7 weeks full-time (estimated)

